From 83dbd80a44373bfdd083eab3b510c8082333c8bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:05:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] FreeChat: join private rooms with a password; block
 screenshots

- Room details (admins): set/change/remove the join password and block
  screenshots in the room (com.freechat.privacy)
- Join screen for rooms you are not in: 'Have a password? Join with it'
- Settings: always block screenshots (account data, all devices)
- FLAG_SECURE is applied in rooms that ask for it and app-wide for the
  personal choice, without undoing the lock screen's own use of the flag
- Masked password dialog that never writes the password to saved state
- MatrixClient.freechatRequest for /_matrix/client/unstable/com.freechat
  via HttpURLConnection (no new dependencies)
- Upstream DefaultJoinRoomEntryPointTest gets the new constructor argument
